  "commentary": [
    {
      "t": 0,
      "text": "Stoppage time in Stockholm, and Sweden want to see this one out."
    },
    {
      "t": 2,
      "text": "Knocked around at the back, no hurry at all."
    },
    {
      "t": 3.6,
      "text": "Now it's launched long, towards Ibrahimović…"
    },
    {
      "t": 5.8,
      "text": "Hart has come a long way off the line for this!"
    },
    {
      "t": 6.6,
      "text": "Hart heads it away, but not very far…"
    },
    {
      "t": 7.35,
      "text": "Ibrahimović is under it, thirty metres out, back to goal…"
    },
    {
      "t": 7.7,
      "text": "Ibrahimović's gone over the top of it! Surely not…"
    },
    {
      "t": 9.35,
      "text": "IT'S IN! From thirty metres, upside down! Unbelievable!"
    },
    {
      "t": 10.8,
      "text": "Ibrahimović's fourth of the night, and they'll talk about that one for years."
    }
  ],
